{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Artisan Goods are items that can be created using ",["l","打造","Artisan Equipment"],". They can take anywhere from a few hours to a few days (in-game time) to be processed."]],["p",["For most Artisan Goods, the star quality of the ingredients used is ignored. The only exceptions are ",["l","蛋黄酱","Mayonnaise"]," made from an ",["l","鸵鸟蛋","Ostrich Egg"],", and ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Fish"],". For these products, the star quality of the artisan product will match that of the ingredient. Additionally, while ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," does not have a star quality itself, it is affected by the quality of the ",["l","动物毛","Wool"]," used, with higher quality wool resulting in higher chances to produce 2 cloth instead of 1."]],["p",["If the ",["l","耕种","Artisan Profession"]," is chosen after reaching level 10 Farming, Artisan Goods will be worth 40% more (with the exception of ",["l","油","Oil"]," and ",["l","咖啡","Coffee"],"). Tree Syrups (",["l","枫糖浆","Maple Syrup"],", ",["l","橡树树脂","Oak Resin"],", ",["l","松焦油","Pine Tar"],", and ",["l","神秘糖浆","Mystic Syrup"],") do not benefit from the Artisan Profession, and are not included here. They are labeled as \"Artisan Goods\" in-game, however. (Their value is instead affected by the ",["l","采集","Tapper Profession"],".) In multiplayer games, if any connected player has the Artisan profession, all items sold will get the boosted price."]],["p",["One Artisan Good, the ",["l","椰林飘香","Piña Colada"],", can be obtained only from the ",["l","姜岛","Island Resort"]," on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," on Sundays when ",["l","格斯","Gus"]," tends the bar there."]]]],["Processing Time",2,[["p",["One hour = 60 minutes from 6am to 2am, but 1 hour = 100 minutes from 2am to 6am."]]]],["Production Machines",2,[["p",["Production machines make products over time without any additional input."]]]],["Bee House",3,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","蜂房","Bee House"]]],["p",["A Bee House produces Wild Honey every 4 days.\nThe Bee House can produce unique types of ",["l","蜂蜜","honey"]," when it is in range of a blooming flower (within 5 tiles in any cardinal direction). When there is more than one type of flower within range, the closest flower takes priority. Flowers placed in ",["l","花盆","garden pots"]," will also cause bee houses to produce flower honey.\nBee houses can be placed inside the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"],", but will not produce honey."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Bee_House.png",48]],[["l","蜂房","Bee House"]],["Place outside and wait for delicious honey! (Except in Winter)."],[["i","(O)388","Wood ×40"],["i","(O)382","Coal ×8"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"],["i","(O)724","Maple Syrup ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 3"]]]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy/Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Processing Time"]},{"h":1,"v":["Availability"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Base Sell Price"]}],[{"r":8,"v":[["f","Honey.png",48]]},{"r":8,"v":[["l","蜂蜜","Honey"]]},{"r":8,"v":["It's a sweet syrup produced by bees."]},{"r":8,"v":["Inedible"]},{"r":8,"v":["4 Nights"]},["All but ",["l","冬季","Winter"]],["Wild"],["100g"]],[{"r":2,"v":["Spring"]},[["i","(O)591","Tulip"]],["160g"]],[[["i","(O)597","Blue Jazz"]],["200g"]],[{"r":3,"v":["Summer"]},[["i","(O)421","Sunflower"]],["260g"]],[[["i","(O)593","Summer Spangle"]],["280g"]],[[["i","(O)376","Poppy"]],["380g"]],[{"r":2,"v":["Fall"]},[["i","(O)421","Sunflower"]],["260g"]],[[["i","(O)595","Fairy Rose"]],["680g"]]]]]],["Processing Machines",2,[["p",["Processing machines take one item and turn it into another item after some time, usually of greater value. Unlike production machines, processing machines require the player to input an item."]]]],["Cask",3,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","木桶","Cask"]]],["p",["See also: ",["l","加工动物制品的收益","Animal Products Profitability"]]],["p",["